# (modeling_jina_embeddings_v5.py:11,15), so peft is required. render mode imports none of
# these (pure string work), so stage 1 of the equivalence check runs on CPU without the
# weights. flash-attention is deliberately NOT pinned: the card marks it "Recommended but
# optional", and its GPU kwargs are unmeasured.

